{"data":{"body":"**P2:** The manager remains `DRAINING` while `checkpointManager.shutdown()` flushes and returns, but `DRAINING` still admits checkpoints and polls. A concurrent caller can therefore enqueue immediately after the batcher has flushed; that request is not covered by shutdown and may execute after the invocation response or remain incomplete. Transition to `CLOSED` after task draining but before shutting down the checkpoint manager, or make shutdown atomically stop admission before its final flush.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc707JbC","finding_digest":"625b542badda3f9b9900ea11022feb4eed61ce608e8d79262a288b97a022583c","finding_id":"arf_v1_mjnvik5n3i7zxgia5iiqel7lj3","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::close::post-shutdown-request-admission","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::close::post-shutdown-request-admission","line":515,"observation_digest":"ebad13c9bdd3fb9c4a33de74cabb01f2807675c46836714fbab18259a12e866e","observation_id":"aro_v1_5owrhsn52p5zysrt3z2mvoyb6k","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-25T22:31:18Z","review_id":"arr_v1_w3qp6dl5ps565recrf6jfxek76","reviewed_base_sha":"1e34529219faee623993b0462bb7fbe72a653b29","reviewed_head_sha":"ebad82c5a501f6beb7a2ede3d4ead07275d99c1c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":513,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":731},"record_id":"art_v1_qpfs5mwa7gupjlx2ngppxwdnk5","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-25T22:31:18Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
